<title>USA: Dow drops more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow drops more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average dropped more than 50 points on Thursday as a rally proved unsustainable despite positive economic data.</p>
<p>Shortly before 2 p.m. (1800 GMT), the Dow was down 52.03 points at 7,876.09.</p>
